.TH ferry-peer-edit 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-peer\-edit \- Change the alias or Auto\-Accept setting of a device
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry peer edit\fR [\fB\-a\fR|\fB\-\-alias\fR] [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-\-auto\-accept\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change the alias or Auto\-Accept setting of a device
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-a\fR, \fB\-\-alias\fR \fI<ALIAS>\fR
New alias
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-\-auto\-accept\fR \fI<AUTO_ACCEPT>\fR
New Auto\-Accept setting
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
true
.IP \(bu 2
false
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Alias or Node ID
